// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Arachnos Warburg Liaison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P678745043" "Arachnos Warburg Liaison"
// ProfessionString :
"P1542643781" "Arachnos Warzone Liason"
// DescriptionString :
"P2859681308" "Speak to a Liason to find out information about a particular Player Vs. Player zone."
// HelloString :
"P4127643763" "This should never appear"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1376081387" "Greetings, {VillainName}. I am the Arachnos Liaison for the Free-Fire PvP zone of Warburg. <color red>Warburg is a Player Vs. Player zone. It is also free-fire, meaning that anyone can attack anyone else outside of the safe areas, whether they are heroes or villains.</color> Warburg is VERY dangerous, and if you go there, you almost certainly will be attacked by other people. <color red>Do not enter Warburg unless you are willing to engage in Player Vs. Player combat</color>. <br><br>If you are interested in entering Warburg, you may do so by speaking to the Pilot behind me. Once there, you may speak with Warzone Operative Braun to get missions inside the zone. He can be found within the safe area. <color red>Braun's missions will take place in a PvP zone. Don't accept them if you are not willing to experience Player versus Player content.</color>."
// LocationString :
"P3437209096" "St. Martial"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


