// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Warzone_Agent_Goddard 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Warzone Agent Goddard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P571856590" "Warzone Agent Goddard"
// ProfessionString :
"P824141666" "Warzone Hero Coordinator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1979714425" "Agent Goddard volunteered to help coordinate hero actions in the hazardous zone called Warburg. His cautiously positive attitude has served him well during the endless battle between the heroes of Paragon City and the villains of the Rogue Isles."
// HelloString :
"P3121944616" "How goes the battle?"
// HelloString :
"P3816911679" "How are things on the lines?"
// HelloString :
"P303343217" "Is the fight going well?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3174887253" "I don't believe you've been cleared yet."
// FirstVisitString :
"P17529004" "Arachnos's Marshal Blitz has gone rogue and taken over the island. While both sides are busy fighting to get control of the rocket out of his hands, there are a lot of other battles that need to be fought as well. That's what I'm here for. By completing missions in this zone, we can hurt Arachnos, and assist our fellow heroes. <color red>All of my missions will take place in Warburg, and while my missions are all against Arachnos, you might still meet hostile players while getting to them. So, if you're not interested in PvP, you might want to pursue another contact.</color>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2088646888" "I think we can take it from here. I think you've got other, more important concerns."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1019577392" "You need to get some of your other missions finished before you can concentrate on Warburg."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3017715630" "We need more heroes here, but you need to be at least security level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P874269763" "You've done some great work, {HeroName}. Keep up the good fight!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3354769465" "You've done a lot to fend off the Villains, {HeroName}, and everybody here knows it."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1443055374" "You shouldn't be spending your time here. There are more important battles for you to fight. <br><br>The battle against Arachnos is being fought in Recluse's Victory. A hero of your power level could help that battle a lot. <br><br>You might want to check out the Shadow Shard. I have a cousin who's with the expeditionary force out there."
// LocationString :
"P1769790454" "Warburg"
// PVPPatrol :
"P4163368833" "Patrol Warburg"
// PVPMission1 :
"P2950633201" "Defuse bombs to debuff villain damage"
// PVPMission2 :
"P948871786" "Rescue officer to debuff villain resistance"
// PVPMission3 :
"P1148683731" "Defend supply depot to buff hero damage"
// PVPMission4 :
"P3149018681" "Recover technology to buff hero resistance"
// IntroString :
"P3967370683" "<color red>This contact is in the PvP zone of Warburg. While he is in a safe area of Warburg, his missions will send you to PvP areas where you may encounter hostile players. Avoid this contact if you do not want PvP content.</color> <br><br>The Freedom Corps' Longbow branch is always looking for heroes to help fight the good fight in contested areas. Warzone Agent Goddard could use your help."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3825209224" "Choose Agent Goddard in a <color red>PVP Zone</color>"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1525706028" "Even if you select Goddard, that doesn't mean you have to do his missions if you change your mind."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P102040438" "There's someone you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1273028133" "There are some people you should meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


