// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Warzone Operative Braun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2428615672" "Warzone Operative Braun"
// ProfessionString :
"P3946548798" "Warzone Specialist Coordinator"
// DescriptionString :
"P3612547533" "Operative Braun was drafted into his position as a coordinator for metahuman specialists in Warburg, but has found his own way to relish the job. He's learned to get a vicarious thrill out watching heroes get pasted by his 'Contractors'."
// HelloString :
"P1973304664" "Oh. You're not dead yet. I see."
// HelloString :
"P3661772483" "{VillainName}? You're still alive?"
// HelloString :
"P2831437585" "Ah, {VillainName}. Good to know that some people still don't understand the concept of 'suicide mission'."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P101692337" "Do you have clearance for this zone?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3723861759" "Marshal Blitz has gone rogue and taken over the island. With both sides attempting to seize control of the rocket, there are still many other tasks that need to be done. to support the battle. That's where I come in. By completing missions in this zone, we can hurt the heroes who have are working with Longbow, and assist all the other villains fighting for control of the rocket. <color red>All of my missions will take place in Warburg, and while my missions are all against Longbow, you might still meet hostile players while getting to them. So, if you're not interested in PvP, you might want to pursue another contact.</color>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1660552299" "I don't have anything more for you. I guess you survived. Isn't that something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3656156034" "You need to finish some of the things you've already committed to, {VillainName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P206794730" "I have something, but you must present a threat of at least level {level} to be worthy of it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1775888575" "Well, you've certainly shown a penchant for survival. That matters for something, I suppose."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3449960559" "All this time spent here and you're still not dead. You're truly quite powerful."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2235441230" "And that's it. There's nothing left for you here. But there is much to do on the other side of the portal in Grandville. That leads to a place we call Recluse's Victory, where villains with your level of power are needed."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1649796295" "<color red>This contact is in the PvP zone of Warburg. While he is in a safe area of Warburg, his missions will send you to PvP areas where you may encounter hostile players. Avoid this contact if you do not want PvP content.</color> <br><br>Arachnos has an open call for unscrupulous metahumans to fight the Paragon City's heroes in contested areas. Warzone Operative Braun could use your help."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2665579932" "Choose Agent Braun in a <color red>PVP Zone</color>"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3937384920" "Even if you select Braun, that doesn't mean you have to do his missions if you change your mind."
// PVPPatrol :
// PVPMission1 :
"P4259122779" "Bomb base to debuff hero damage"
// PVPMission2 :
"P1542346459" "Kidnap officer to debuff hero resistance"
// PVPMission3 :
"P2268943477" "Destroy supply depot to buff villain damage"
// PVPMission4 :
"P1435601356" "Steal technology to buff villain resistance"
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
